WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.290
paralysis. Here, nightmares
become something else entirely.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.630
You wake up. Or, at
least, you think you do.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.530
You're lying in bed, fully
conscious, eyes open.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.350
You can see your room.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:19.810
You know where you are, but you can't
move, not your arms, not your legs,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.290
not even your fingers.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.890
You try to scream, but no sound comes out.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.490
Your body has betrayed you completely,
and then you realize you're not alone.

